'''Ancient Egg: N101''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked from the [[Catnip Challenges]] after completing 5 [[Behemoth Culling]] stages for the first time. It was added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]]. [[True Form]] massively increases overall stats, increases cost and recharge time, while also gaining Behemoth Slayer, Long Distance and Area Attacks.

