==Trivia==
*Since many Behemoths are already Monster Hunter references, Courier Cat is likely based on the Courier in [[wikipedia:Monster Hunter Rise|Monster Hunter Rise]].
*Courier Cat's Japanese name, Hikyaku Neko (飛脚ネコ), shows that this unit is based on ''[[wikipedia:Hikyaku|hikyaku]]'', a type of courier in feudal Japan.
*The [[Killer Cat (Rare Cat)|Killer Cat]] in its attack animation may be an indirect reference to the Japanese delivery service [https://www.kuronekoyamato.co.jp/en/ Kuroneko Yamato], as Killer Cat's Japanese name is Kuroneko and a courier is a form of deliveryman.

